// The Delts app does NOT embed any API key.
//
// All Gemini access is routed through the delts.fit server-side proxy
// (web/api/gemini.js), which holds GEMINI_API_KEY as a Vercel environment
// variable. There is no local key to configure for the app to build or run.
//
// To point the app at a different proxy during development, add a
// GEMINI_PROXY_URL entry to the app's Info.plist (see GeminiConfig.swift).
//
// This file is kept only so existing project references resolve; it is safe
// to leave empty.
